        "Equity and Efficiency Trade-off"@en,
        "Equity-Efficiency Tradeoff"@en ;
    skos:broader hewc:opportunity-cost,
        hewc:trade-off ;
    skos:definition "The equity-efficiency trade-off is the total health given up for a fairer distribution when the option that maximises health is not the fairest one."@en ;
