heo:modifies a owl:AnnotationProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Modifies"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Descriptive link for people to read (no inference)."@en ;
    skos:definition "Subject is a rule, criterion, factor or weight that adjusts the value of Object, or changes when Object applies, while Object keeps its own meaning. For example, Severity Modifier modifies Cost-Effectiveness Threshold."@en ;
    skos:example "Paediatric Exclusivity Modifies First Generic Entry"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A conceptual association between meanings, not a measured effect in any population or setting. Actual effects, and the evidence for them, are described in RHEO and in the sources on the concept pages."@en ;
    heo:applicationUse heo:Navigation .

