        <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000057>,
        <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/rheo/RHEO_1000057> ;
    skos:definition "Subject, an organisation, facility or role, carries out or delivers the activity or service that is Object. For example, Third-Party Administrator performs Claims Processing."@en ;
    skos:example "Hospital HTA Unit Performs Mini-HTA"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A conceptual association, not a claim about a particular organisation. It records that carrying out the object is part of what the subject concept means. What actual organisations or people did is described in RHEO."@en ;
